sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Citizen
    participant A as AssignmentEngine
    participant S as Staff
    participant W as WardAdmin
    participant F as Firestore

    C->>F: Create Complaint (Status: Submitted)
    Note over A,F: 3-Hour Review Window
    A->>F: Auto-Assignment Sweep (After 3 Hours)
    A->>F: Identify & Assign Best Staff (Status: Assigned)
    F->>S: Notify Assignment
    S->>F: Update Status (Status: In Progress)
    S->>F: Upload Photos & Remarks
    S->>F: Resolve Complaint (Status: Resolved)
    F->>W: Notify Resolution
    F->>C: Notify Resolution
    W->>F: Close Complaint (Status: Closed)
    Note over A,F: 7-Day Inactivity Sweep
    A->>F: Auto-Close Resolved Complaints (Status: Closed)
    C->>F: (Optional) Reopen if unhappy
